{"2478130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wild Wild Eden", "steam_appid": 2478130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/1122c98195fce6055a301ba2642edf33.poster.avif?t=1787045869\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/1122c98195fce6055a301ba2642edf33.webm?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/1122c98195fce6055a301ba2642edf33.mp4?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/be567a15be4e01a84d82b0390add0cc5.poster.avif?t=1787045869\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/be567a15be4e01a84d82b0390add0cc5.webm?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/be567a15be4e01a84d82b0390add0cc5.mp4?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build your ultimate sanctuary alongside mysterious creatures and defend it from the hidden perils of this world. Join forces with your companions to uncover the realm's ancient secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Explore</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/c98894af14cd99c970b14f3dd8fa52a2.poster.avif?t=1787045869\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/c98894af14cd99c970b14f3dd8fa52a2.webm?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/c98894af14cd99c970b14f3dd8fa52a2.mp4?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken in a breathtaking, uncharted primitive world. Bond with powerful companions to conquer the land, sea, and sky, turning a beautiful but perilous wilderness into your ultimate playground.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Resource gathering</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/a2321907c48310814b9f480242919eab.poster.avif?t=1787045869\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/a2321907c48310814b9f480242919eab.webm?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/a2321907c48310814b9f480242919eab.mp4?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest wood and stone to secure essential survival resources. Bring the right companions along to maximize your efficiency—they are always eager to lend a helping hand!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Crafting</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/f7097dc613e682f9490464ddc55aead5.poster.avif?t=1787045869\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/f7097dc613e682f9490464ddc55aead5.webm?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/f7097dc613e682f9490464ddc55aead5.mp4?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize gathered resources to forge advanced gear and weapons essential for survival. Assign your creatures to processing stations, channeling their unique abilities to power your entire camp's infrastructure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Building</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/6a289cbf4854fd86eace7cadad927961.poster.avif?t=1787045869\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/6a289cbf4854fd86eace7cadad927961.webm?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/6a289cbf4854fd86eace7cadad927961.mp4?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy unrestricted building freedom across the wilderness. Design a safe, thriving paradise where you and your creatures can live and survive side by side.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Taming</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/267d74382aa216557605e9ebe6bbefc8.poster.avif?t=1787045869\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/267d74382aa216557605e9ebe6bbefc8.webm?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/267d74382aa216557605e9ebe6bbefc8.mp4?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is full of mysterious monsters waiting for your protection. Set up traps, lull them to sleep with a Dream Brew, and tame them to welcome them home.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Farming</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/f1710f34f1156f941db6084eb5b6d1db.poster.avif?t=1787045869\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/f1710f34f1156f941db6084eb5b6d1db.webm?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/f1710f34f1156f941db6084eb5b6d1db.mp4?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave the watering and fertilizing to the ones who do it best. Share the crops you’ve grown together and enjoy a cozy, moderately automated slow life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Player combat</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/3e1f6a509e43a4b43f568a2b853844e5.poster.avif?t=1787045869\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/3e1f6a509e43a4b43f568a2b853844e5.webm?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/3e1f6a509e43a4b43f568a2b853844e5.mp4?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger is always around the corner in this primitive world. When enemies threaten your beloved family, you must take up arms yourself and lay your life on the line to protect them!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Boss fight</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/b492de391010c8ec2c7b25698cdae0ac.poster.avif?t=1787045869\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/b492de391010c8ec2c7b25698cdae0ac.webm?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478130/extras/b492de391010c8ec2c7b25698cdae0ac.mp4?t=1787045869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate test of your family's bond. Launch an all-out assault alongside the trusty companions who survived this harsh world with you, and strike down mighty threats!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam